te":"Clayard is a mining town of 3956 people just nearby the clay mine."},{"icon":"glyph-26cf-fe0f","type":"mines","dx":48,"px":13,"x":1473.28,"y":482.05,"cell":2938,"i":9,"name":"Ghizziz — clay mining town","note":"Ghizziz is a mining town of 11469 people just nearby the clay mine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f309","type":"bridges","px":14,"x":543.15,"y":765.12,"cell":5339,"i":10,"name":"Ghostvame Bridge","note":"A formidable bridge spans over the Earthgakec River near Ghostvame."},{"icon":"glyph-1f309","type":"bridges","px":14,"x":424.84,"y":750.9,"cell":5226,"i":11,"name":"Clifront Bridge","note":"A weathered bridge spans over the Suncairnter River near Clifront."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":534.19,"y":750.2,"cell":5234,"i":12,"name":"The Fat Beaver","note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious boiled beaver with purple juice is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1028.43,"y":332.48,"cell":1597,"i":13,"name":"The Huge Tavern","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious poached pudding with purple tequila is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1101.83,"y":682.8,"cell":4834,"i":14,"name":"The Ancient Fox","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious stuffed pike with sour whisky is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1617.07,"y":450.26,"cell":2710,"i":15,"name":"The Loud Scorpion","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dried boar with sparkling vodka is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1173.07,"y":735.8,"cell":5176,"i":16,"name":"The Big Tavern","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious roasted peas with pink wine is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":413.84,"y":766.01,"cell":5328,"i":17,"name":"The Blue Crane","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious braised carp with sour spirits is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":258.07,"y":749.27,"cell":5214,"i":18,"name":"The Green Lion","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious corned beef with sweet mead is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1566.16,"y":478.12,"cell":2946,"i":19,"name":"The Loud Narwhal","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious cured deer with yellow liquor is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1608.83,"y":453.23,"cell":2708,"i":20,"name":"The High Tavern","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dry-aged hart with pink sap is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a8","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":196.34,"y":607.26,"cell":4068,"i":21,"name":"Everchan Lighthouse","note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a8","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":1481.99,"y":338.67,"cell":1727,"i":22,"name":"Rezgniz Lighthouse","note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"glyph-27f1","type":"waterfalls","dy":54,"px":16,"x":1581.25,"y":583.79,"cell":3929,"i":23,"name":"Shaneaneth Waterfall","note":"The rapids of an exceptionally beautiful waterfall."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":668.58,"y":789.59,"cell":5570,"i":24,"name":"Mighthtown Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Stilian Intervention. \r\nDate: April 6, 813 Azion Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1351.13,"y":402.45,"cell":2161,"i":25,"name":"Bash Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Uzdan Invasion. \r\nDate: September 10, 813 Azion Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1322.22,"y":610.53,"cell":4161,"i":26,"name":"Brogroz Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Neg Rebellion. \r\nDate: March 13, 386 Azion Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1306.99,"y":649.48,"cell":4515,"i":27,"name":"Kogrurd Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Gidh Conquest. \r\nDate: September 1, 587 Azion Era."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":804.06,"y":169.8,"cell":494,"i":28,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=712000967494\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=712000967494\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":559.08,"y":182.16,"cell":559,"i":29,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=712000967559\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=712000967559\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":372.35,"y":379.29,"cell":1972,"i":30,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7120009671972\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7120009671972\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":489.35,"y":438.6,"cell":2487,"i":31,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7120009672487\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=7120009672487\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f409","type":"lake-monsters","dy":48,"x":382.42,"y":583.74,"cell":3829,"i":32,"name":"Wandering Monster","note":"Locals say a relic monster of 9 ft long inhabits Wandering Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":448.96,"y":172.86,"cell":454,"i":33,"name":"Cocke Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 10 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":696.04,"y":200.03,"cell":664,"i":34,"name":"Southam Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 37 ft long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":582.45,"y":531.92,"cell":3363,"i":35,"name":"Tumunbarakz Cyclops","note":"Locals speak of a lucky Cyclops who inhabits Tumunbarakz hills and snatches people from homes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":673.21,"y":243.13,"cell":1029,"i":36,"name":"Kizir Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Zizah Beliefs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f332","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":993.81,"y":194.59,"cell":690,"i":37,"name":"Felnir Pinery","note":"A pinery sacred to local Rake (Drakonic)ism."},{"icon":"glyph-1f334","type":"sacred-palm-groves","px":13,"x":373.61,"y":495.5,"cell":2980,"i":38,"name":"Auryhost Palm Grove","note":"A palm grove sacred to local Arsitesism."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":479.41,"y":771.06,"cell":5440,"i":39,"name":"Swampmoor Jackals","note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1432.8,"y":613.7,"cell":4170,"i":40,"name":"Noggorra Jackals","note":"A gang of forest highwaymen."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1013.88,"y":216.37,"cell":877,"i":41,"name":"Aulansistamn Rats","note":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":990.5,"y":683,"cell":4713,"i":42,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":494.81,"y":169.98,"cell":461,"i":43,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1117.8,"y":608.6,"cell":4016,"i":44,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":424.23,"y":655.19,"cell":4447,"i":45,"name":"Oldham Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡁᡜᡴᠳᠦᡖᡙᢥᡳᡐ᠀ᠰᢦᠽᡓᢦᡖᠽᡍᢛᡓᡭᡀᢋᡀ᠀ᠧᡖᢠᠳᠵᠿᢂᠰᡆᢤᠼᡔᡏᡱᢓᡕᡁᠠᢐᢜᢐᡖᡡᡁᡍᠲᡠᡁᠳᠮᡑᢛᡎᡳᡯᡒᢁᠭᡯᡰᠡᢛᡰᠳᡴᢋᡴᠧᡗᡀᠡᡍᠯᡁᠻᢀᢑᠪᡀᠲᡲᢀᡐᡙᢁᠡᡴᢠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1632.36,"y":534.32,"cell":3439,"i":46,"name":"Harwindra Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ጰደከከረፐፈፐየደመሀቀኀ ሐተወሐደወደደደሀቀነዐገጰደየጸሰፀሠረሠቀደለኀለሠረየሐሐፐሰ ሀደ  ለየፀተ  ረጠረጠረሰዐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":522.18,"y":417.34,"cell":2350,"i":47,"name":"Bilarakzir Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳭⳭⳖⲶⲲⳔⲼⲺⳢⳔ⳹ⳂⲴ⳧ⳢⳜⲼ  ⲲⳀⳞⳘⳈⳚⳁⳘ⳹ⳀⳘⳫⳎ⳥ⲸⲸⲴⳄ⳾ⲸⲼ⳥ⳐⲴⳘ⳹ⲺⳖ ⳲⳐⲲⳌⲺⲴⳔⲸⳤ⳪ ⲾⳭⳐⳞⳜⳊⲴⳚⳲⳂⲸⳠⳎ⳩ⳤⳐⳄ⳧ⳫⳒⲶⳭ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1548.83,"y":499.95,"cell":3190,"i":48,"name":"Ruined Settlement","note":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1188.09,"y":621.32,"cell":4278,"i":49,"name":"Ruined Sacred site","note":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1150.43,"y":522.93,"cell":3285,"i":50,"name":"Ruined Stronghold","note":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":563.2,"y":590.62,"cell":3843,"i":51,"name":"Ruined Outpost","note":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":395.13,"y":332.25,"cell":1548,"i":52,"name":"Khiz Library","note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":515.05,"y":670.35,"cell":4571,"i":53,"name":"Travelling Fantastical Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this fantastical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1475.69,"y":382.47,"cell":2058,"i":54,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":617.51,"y":271.65,"cell":1197,"i":55,"name":"Azinarg Competition","note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a competition of brutality in Azinarg, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":347.82,"y":391.04,"cell":2082,"i":56,"name":"Tunar Fair","note":"A fair is being held in Tunar, offering local grain, coal, and arms alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":1574.59,"y":503.33,"cell":3192,"i":57,"name":"Minor Jetty","note":"A small location along the Aquenntyn River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":646.2,"y":804.5,"cell":5676,"i":58,"name":"Bears migration","note":"A huge group of bears are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4a6","type":"mirage","x":1272.19,"y":493.53,"cell":3047,"i":59,"name":"Diaphanous mirage","note":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1196.93,"y":527.15,"cell":3407,"i":60,"name":"Vrobrun Cave","note":"The Vrobrun Cave. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":520.57,"y":675.49,"cell":4685,"i":61,"name":"Stormbur