i Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1078.25,"y":731.81,"cell":5167,"i":70,"name":"Clifrost Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f386","type":"rifts","x":607.19,"y":381.57,"cell":1990,"i":71,"name":"Ancient Rift","note":"A rumoured ancient rift in this area is causing all known nearby beings to flee in terror."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":1125.65,"y":341.21,"cell":1702,"i":72,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":1376.05,"y":440.18,"cell":2554,"i":73,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1188.9,"y":492.06,"cell":3041,"i":74,"name":"Krag Sepulchre","note":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1534.97,"y":357.04,"cell":1844,"i":75,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1844\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":559.05,"y":690.83,"cell":4802,"i":76,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4802\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1